WEBVTT

00:29.112 --> 00:30.197
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:33.283 --> 00:34.909
CHARACTERS, EVENTS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND PLACES IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:34.910 --> 00:36.203
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

00:38.539 --> 00:40.374
Mom, don't go.

00:41.250 --> 00:42.417
Let me come with you!

00:45.462 --> 00:47.588
Mom…

00:51.593 --> 00:53.178
Let me keep this, Dad.

00:54.805 --> 00:56.890
Dad…

00:59.559 --> 01:02.853
You shouldn't accept kids
without their parents' permission!

01:02.854 --> 01:04.773
- I…
- Come with me.

01:11.655 --> 01:12.738
Okay.

01:12.739 --> 01:14.865
Dad! Dad!

01:14.866 --> 01:17.244
I promise not to draw anymore, so…

01:18.120 --> 01:19.705
So please let me stay in Korea.

01:24.042 --> 01:26.920
EPISODE 3

01:45.897 --> 01:47.482
I'll see you. Excuse me.

02:04.833 --> 02:06.918
Are you using this room by yourself?

02:08.420 --> 02:11.381
No, I have a roommate,
but he's traveling right now.

02:13.675 --> 02:14.760
Do you want a drink?

02:35.781 --> 02:37.324
Father…

02:43.705 --> 02:45.665
That's just…

03:41.304 --> 03:43.431
How long are you going to keep doing this?

03:43.432 --> 03:46.184
What more do I have to do
to make you stop?

04:40.280 --> 04:42.282
I kept forcing myself to hang on,

04:43.325 --> 04:45.952
but I couldn't find
any reason to keep going,

04:46.661 --> 04:49.289
so I eventually decided to end it all.

04:55.879 --> 05:00.007
But then she disturbed me really loudly.

05:08.600 --> 05:10.059
Ran
CHAN, CHAN, CHAN!

05:10.060 --> 05:11.143
Oh…

05:11.144 --> 05:12.728
The pen you sent me
for my birthday…

05:12.729 --> 05:16.816
I used it to draw a design,
and it won in our company contest!

05:16.817 --> 05:19.401
- Let's go!
-  It won?

05:19.402 --> 05:21.487
Thank you so much!

05:21.488 --> 05:22.489
You know,

05:23.073 --> 05:24.616
you're my savior.

05:25.617 --> 05:26.660
"You're…

05:29.412 --> 05:30.455
my savior."

05:31.122 --> 05:34.459
And that disruption
gave me an opportunity.

05:35.335 --> 05:37.628
An opportunity to live again.

05:41.216 --> 05:42.217
Ran
DARN IT!

05:46.555 --> 05:48.556
Oh, gosh. They said it's a fake.

05:48.557 --> 05:51.809
That Gold-something that helps you sleep.
I heard there's no proof.

05:51.810 --> 05:53.519
I should've looked into it
before telling you.

06:14.499 --> 06:17.042
Why did it suddenly get so lively?

06:17.043 --> 06:19.503
It's like music to wake you up.

06:19.504 --> 06:21.089
I'm so sorry.

06:30.098 --> 06:31.473
Shocking news.

06:31.474 --> 06:33.767
I was eating lunch with my teammates,

06:33.768 --> 06:35.019
and there was…

06:35.020 --> 06:36.979
dun dun, eggplant in it.

06:36.980 --> 06:38.106
Gross.

06:40.442 --> 06:41.525
Eggplant?

06:41.526 --> 06:45.404
It's all mushy and squishy,
and it's neon-colored. Yuck!

06:45.405 --> 06:46.947
The taste of a neon alien.

06:56.708 --> 06:57.792
Mmm.

06:59.794 --> 07:01.254
A neon alien…

07:01.838 --> 07:05.215
I laughed properly for the first time
thanks to her.

07:06.801 --> 07:08.969
I used to be trapped in a tiny world,

07:08.970 --> 07:12.849
and it grew wider because of her.

07:14.851 --> 07:17.270
But that person
who laughed and shone so brightly…

07:18.688 --> 07:19.773
keeps crying now.

07:20.899 --> 07:22.149
She keeps hiding.

07:23.234 --> 07:25.694
I want to do the same for her now

07:25.695 --> 07:28.657
and help her live joyfully again.

07:29.449 --> 07:33.870
Because she was a grateful disruption
that made me live again.

07:36.164 --> 07:39.876
Is it okay if I start being
really nice to you from now on?

07:45.799 --> 07:46.800
No,

07:47.509 --> 07:48.842
you can't.

07:48.843 --> 07:49.844
What?

07:50.470 --> 07:51.595
Why?

07:51.596 --> 07:52.846
Oh, right.

07:52.847 --> 07:55.100
I just want to repay you for what you did.

07:57.477 --> 08:00.230
If it's because of those clothes,
it's fine.

08:00.855 --> 08:04.025
I have no intention
of getting close to anyone.

08:07.946 --> 08:09.406
What if there's a time limit?

08:13.535 --> 08:14.661
I…

08:15.412 --> 08:17.414
I just meant…

08:18.331 --> 08:22.043
We can be friends while I'm in Korea.

08:22.794 --> 08:25.255
Just for three months.

08:33.555 --> 08:35.681
We'll keep seeing each other
at work and at SHIM.

08:35.682 --> 08:36.807
So…

08:36.808 --> 08:39.143
"Let's live so I won't have any regrets."

08:39.144 --> 08:40.936
You said that was your motto.

08:40.937 --> 08:43.732
"Let's not get close to anyone.
Then nothing will happen."

08:44.274 --> 08:45.859
That's my motto.

08:46.693 --> 08:50.988
I'll get along with you very well
as a colleague.

08:50.989 --> 08:54.325
But I will never get close
to you personally.

09:01.916 --> 09:03.333
A three-month trial!

09:05.086 --> 09:07.088
You know, like free trials
in apps and games.

09:07.756 --> 09:09.174
There's nothing to lose.

09:10.050 --> 09:12.009
You can use me as a friend
when you're bored

09:12.010 --> 09:13.845
or a misunderstanding for Ms. Kim.

09:14.345 --> 09:15.930
Just try me out as a free trial.

09:16.681 --> 09:21.186
As soon as the three months is over,
I'll disappear without a trace.

09:23.855 --> 09:25.607
All right, fine.

09:27.692 --> 09:29.651
You really don't want to be friends?

09:29.652 --> 09:31.279
No.

09:32.781 --> 09:35.575
Okay. I understand.

09:36.201 --> 09:38.870
Then, I'll make you want
to become my friend.

09:39.913 --> 09:41.205
- Excuse me?
- Mmm.

09:43.833 --> 09:45.251
I hope you get better soon.

09:47.504 --> 09:48.505
What…

10:07.273 --> 10:10.443
HERBAL TEA

11:21.264 --> 11:23.391
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

11:23.933 --> 11:25.017
Haran.

11:32.150 --> 11:34.651
Geez. Are you a bear?

11:34.652 --> 11:36.404
You're sleeping in the cave now?

11:37.030 --> 11:39.449
I fell asleep.

11:40.283 --> 11:42.492
Come downstairs.

11:42.493 --> 11:44.037
I have something to announce.

11:45.788 --> 11:49.791
First of all, thank you
for gathering early in the morning.

11:49.792 --> 11:53.086
Please understand,
since I'm a busy high school senior.

11:53.087 --> 11:55.089
I'm sleepy. Just get to the point, please.

11:56.758 --> 11:58.218
Okay, I will.

12:00.595 --> 12:01.721
I'm going to get married.

12:03.097 --> 12:08.727
Mmm. You're always planning things,
but aren't you planning way too far ahead?

12:08.728 --> 12:12.857
No, I want to get married in a few months.

12:15.318 --> 12:17.444
- With whom?
- My boyfriend.

12:17.445 --> 12:20.615
What do you mean?
How can you just get married…

12:23.368 --> 12:24.618
Wait a minute.

12:24.619 --> 12:27.913
I trust you,
but this is really sudden,

12:27.914 --> 12:30.332
so I'm asking just in case.

12:30.333 --> 12:33.210
- Are you…
- Don't be ridiculous.

12:33.211 --> 12:36.546
We've been dating purely
without crossing the line.

12:36.547 --> 12:38.340
Don't even think about it.

12:38.341 --> 12:40.676
Tell me. Who is he?

12:40.677 --> 12:42.886
I've known him since elementary school.

12:42.887 --> 12:45.889
Cha Yougyum.
He's in our school's baseball team.

12:45.890 --> 12:50.311
He should focus on baseball
instead of seducing our innocent Hadam.

12:50.937 --> 12:54.064
He's an innocent guy
who only thinks about baseball and me.

12:54.065 --> 12:55.816
I'm the one who suggested marriage.

12:55.817 --> 12:59.611
Fine, let's say you get married.
How will you make a living?

12:59.612 --> 13:02.656
He's joining the Major League.
He's joining the New York Comets.

13:02.657 --> 13:03.741
It was on the news.

13:04.325 --> 13:05.617
The Comets?

13:05.618 --> 13:09.329
So are you saying
you'll give up your studies

13:09.330 --> 13:11.540
and go to the US with him?

13:11.541 --> 13:15.502
No, I'm going to medical school here
like I planned.

13:15.503 --> 13:19.548
I want us to get married
so I won't feel anxious when he's away.

13:19.549 --> 13:21.466
Things won't change much right away.

13:21.467 --> 13:24.428
She planned everything already.

13:24.429 --> 13:25.679
Hey, Hadam.

13:25.680 --> 13:28.056
You don't know much about life yet, so--

13:28.057 --> 13:29.725
Wait.

13:29.726 --> 13:31.143
Let me meet him first.

13:31.144 --> 13:33.313
Grandma!

13:34.314 --> 13:35.439
All right.

13:35.440 --> 13:38.650
He's in Jeju Island for a competition,
so I'll bring him home after.

13:38.651 --> 13:42.280
Okay. We'll discuss this after I meet him.

13:47.910 --> 13:51.372
I have to go study now,
so I'll see you later.

13:52.206 --> 13:53.291
Song Hadam.

13:54.542 --> 13:56.835
Hey. How…

13:56.836 --> 13:59.464
Haran. Sis!

14:00.298 --> 14:03.508
Shouldn't you say something
as the eldest sister?

14:03.509 --> 14:05.928
Grandma said she'll discuss it
after meeting him.

14:06.429 --> 14:07.555
Go get ready for work.

14:08.139 --> 14:09.140
What?

14:10.475 --> 14:12.100
How are they all so relaxed

14:12.101 --> 14:14.270
when a teenager said
she's getting married?

14:15.605 --> 14:18.024
Mom, Dad. Isn't this crazy?

14:29.619 --> 14:32.829
Then, I'll make you want
to become my friend.

14:32.830 --> 14:34.873
I'll make you want
to become my friend.

14:36.626 --> 14:38.503
What is he trying to do?

14:42.006 --> 14:43.299
Do you have a meeting here?

14:44.008 --> 14:46.760
No, I just wanted to get everyone coffee.

14:46.761 --> 14:48.303
Coffee? Nice!

14:48.304 --> 14:50.014
I'll be back in a second.

14:53.476 --> 14:56.187
Oh. Ms. Song, what are you doing?

14:56.854 --> 14:59.190
It's nothing.

15:04.862 --> 15:07.489
Mmm.

15:07.490 --> 15:08.533
This is good.

15:12.537 --> 15:14.037
Where's Ms. Song?

15:14.038 --> 15:16.249
She disappears at 12 on the dot.

15:16.958 --> 15:19.918
Is she Lunch Cinderella or what?
Where is she even going?

15:19.919 --> 15:22.088
Does she think I'll get curious about her?

15:23.089 --> 15:25.382
Since you're here, have lunch with us.

15:25.383 --> 15:26.967
Sorry, I'll pass today.

15:26.968 --> 15:28.886
Next time. Enjoy your lunch.

15:31.389 --> 15:32.639
Genius.

15:32.640 --> 15:35.642
Are you visiting, too?

15:35.643 --> 15:36.727
Aww.

15:38.312 --> 15:40.355
I can't go to SHIM for a while.

15:40.356 --> 15:41.982
I'll see you later.

16:05.464 --> 16:06.465
Ugh...

16:27.737 --> 16:30.238
No way.

16:37.205 --> 16:38.371
I'm sorry.

16:38.372 --> 16:41.959
Are you okay?
I'll order the same one for you.

16:45.421 --> 16:48.216
Okay. Let's run the meeting
with Lafayette like this.

16:48.925 --> 16:50.634
Is there anything else? If that's it…

16:50.635 --> 16:52.553
I want to say something.

16:53.221 --> 16:54.430
Go on.

16:55.598 --> 17:00.352
I want to be excluded
from the animation collaboration.

17:06.067 --> 17:07.151
Why?

17:07.985 --> 17:11.780
Well, I don't know much about animation,

17:11.781 --> 17:13.865
and I don't think I'm skilled enough--

17:13.866 --> 17:14.909
Stop.

17:15.534 --> 17:16.786
That's a long excuse.

17:18.329 --> 17:19.621
Prove yourself instead.

17:19.622 --> 17:20.790
Just do it, no matter what.

17:22.833 --> 17:23.834
That's it for today.

17:25.294 --> 17:28.297
Thank you.

17:46.857 --> 17:48.734
Mr. Park. Oh…

17:50.069 --> 17:51.403
Is she not here?

17:51.404 --> 17:53.488
Do you need to see her?

17:53.489 --> 17:55.699
It's nothing.
I'll head upstairs.

17:55.700 --> 17:56.993
All right.

18:05.543 --> 18:06.710
Ah.

18:06.711 --> 18:09.004
- I'm heading out for a bit!
- Okay.

18:10.715 --> 18:13.300
He just got here. Where is he going?

18:13.301 --> 18:15.511
Mr. Park, I'm going upstairs!

18:17.305 --> 18:19.014
Mr. Park, I'm heading out!

18:19.015 --> 18:21.099
- Where are you going?
- Just buying something!

18:21.100 --> 18:23.435
- Good boy. Wait.
-  I'm going upstairs!

18:25.771 --> 18:27.731
-  Is it broken?
- Did you break something?

18:27.732 --> 18:31.027
No, it's fine.
I'm going upstairs.

18:33.863 --> 18:37.908
Genius, do you know why he's so busy?

19:01.432 --> 19:03.476
- Yes, this is Nana Atelier--
-  Help me.

19:03.976 --> 19:05.393
Hayeong?

19:05.394 --> 19:07.229
It's 39,000 won.

19:11.442 --> 19:13.902
I'll transfer the money.
It's fine.

19:13.903 --> 19:16.072
It's okay. Eat as much as you want.

19:17.698 --> 19:18.782
Here.

19:18.783 --> 19:19.991
YUMMY SNACK BAR

19:19.992 --> 19:21.117
Okay.

19:21.118 --> 19:22.578
Then I'll treat you next time.

19:25.873 --> 19:27.791
Here. Have one.

19:27.792 --> 19:30.335
- It's fine--
- Come on. Try it.

19:30.336 --> 19:32.879
I mean, no one carries around
cash these days.

19:32.880 --> 19:34.882
I was about to transfer the money,

19:35.591 --> 19:39.553
but I left my phone
at the office.

19:40.304 --> 19:43.098
So I borrowed the owner's phone
and called,

19:43.099 --> 19:46.935
hoping someone would pick up at work.

19:46.936 --> 19:49.729
And, wow, the man
who always goes home last

19:49.730 --> 19:51.731
picked up and saved me.

19:51.732 --> 19:54.067
Applause.

19:54.068 --> 19:55.194
Hang on.

19:57.029 --> 19:58.280
Hey, Chaewon.

19:58.781 --> 19:59.782
A blind date?

20:00.616 --> 20:02.368
Okay, send me his profile.

20:03.202 --> 20:04.328
Okay.

20:07.123 --> 20:08.289
Someone saw my photo

20:08.290 --> 20:10.333
and asked my friend
to set us up on a date.

20:10.334 --> 20:11.752
He said I'm his type.

20:14.255 --> 20:17.133
I always end up just being friends
with guys on blind dates.

20:19.468 --> 20:22.805
But this time, it might be different.

20:23.514 --> 20:24.557
He's handsome, right?

20:25.099 --> 20:28.811
"Cha Min."
Even his name is nice.

20:29.687 --> 20:31.105
What do you think, Mr. Yeon?

20:32.857 --> 20:34.733
I'm not so sure.

20:34.734 --> 20:36.777
You're not so sure?

20:37.403 --> 20:39.071
Mmm. He looks okay.

20:39.864 --> 20:42.199
Thank you.

20:43.159 --> 20:44.576
Bye!

20:44.577 --> 20:46.828
-  Come again next time!
-  Okay.

20:46.829 --> 20:48.205
Right, my phone!

20:51.333 --> 20:52.668
Bye!

21:05.765 --> 21:07.892
CHARACTER "WON"

21:11.061 --> 21:15.357
I want to be excluded
from the animation collaboration.

21:18.319 --> 21:19.945
Did they argue?

21:22.531 --> 21:23.532
Hang on.

21:24.784 --> 21:25.826
No…

21:29.371 --> 21:32.041
I'm going on a blind date.

21:32.833 --> 21:33.834
Okay.

21:34.585 --> 21:37.003
Were you two deceiving me?

21:37.004 --> 21:38.380
What?

21:39.298 --> 21:42.176
You're seeing someone,
but you're at home on a weekend?

21:44.303 --> 21:45.887
You were lying to me, weren't you?

21:45.888 --> 21:47.430
We weren't lying.

21:47.431 --> 21:50.058
Didn't you say you were meeting him today?

21:50.059 --> 21:51.226
What?

21:51.227 --> 21:55.356
I… Gosh, it's time to go.
We can head out together.

21:56.732 --> 21:58.275
See you later.

21:58.818 --> 21:59.819
Bye!

22:04.573 --> 22:06.367
That's suspicious.

22:07.827 --> 22:09.119
Is it really true?

22:13.749 --> 22:16.084
Hayeong, why do you keep doing this?

22:16.085 --> 22:19.003
Shh! This is for your sake.

22:19.004 --> 22:21.422
Mr. Yoon won't be
the only one on Grandma's list.

22:21.423 --> 22:23.299
Just spend some time outside.

22:23.300 --> 22:25.301
You can go to Genius' coffee shop.

22:25.302 --> 22:26.846
I can't go there.

22:27.471 --> 22:29.514
- Maybe I should go to the office.
- No.

22:29.515 --> 22:31.516
Don't you know Grandma?

22:31.517 --> 22:33.685
I bet she checks all the entrance records.

22:34.770 --> 22:37.105
Hang in there, okay?

22:37.106 --> 22:38.523
Bye!

22:38.524 --> 22:39.817
Mr. Cha? Hi.

22:41.110 --> 22:42.820
Darn it.

22:44.321 --> 22:45.698
I have nowhere to go.

22:53.873 --> 22:56.750
The course was so tough today.

22:59.378 --> 23:00.671
Gosh.

23:02.256 --> 23:03.465
There's a large variety.

23:05.217 --> 23:08.636
Then I'll make you want
to become my friend.

23:08.637 --> 23:12.390
I'll make you want
to become my friend.

23:12.391 --> 23:13.767
Geez.

23:14.810 --> 23:18.396
You ran around a lot today,
so this is on me today.

23:18.397 --> 23:20.940
So have anything you want.

23:20.941 --> 23:22.650
I'm going to have
something expensive.

23:22.651 --> 23:23.861
Who are you?

23:24.445 --> 23:25.988
What? I…

23:26.405 --> 23:28.908
Ah.  I have a girlfriend.

23:30.492 --> 23:33.536
No, it's not that.
Sorry. I'll just sit here for a second.

23:33.537 --> 23:35.872
You were amazing, Mr. Seonu.

23:35.873 --> 23:37.540
How were you so good on your first day?

23:37.541 --> 23:42.295
I was just doing my best
not to fall behind.

23:42.296 --> 23:45.298
Number 26, your order's ready.

23:47.301 --> 23:49.052
You can have this.

23:49.053 --> 23:52.013
Number 26, your salad is ready.

23:52.014 --> 23:53.432
Number 26?

23:54.767 --> 23:58.061
Number 26, your order is ready.

23:58.062 --> 23:59.772
Number 26?

24:24.421 --> 24:26.047
It's only 5:00 p.m.

24:26.048 --> 24:27.091
Tsk.

24:28.092 --> 24:30.134
You're good!

24:31.845 --> 24:33.680
You're so good!

24:33.681 --> 24:34.807
- Right?
-  You're amazing!

24:36.141 --> 24:39.310
Then I'll make you want
to become my friend.

24:39.311 --> 24:40.979
I'll make you want
to become my friend.

24:43.357 --> 24:44.649
What is he doing here?

24:44.650 --> 24:45.942
I want to do it, too.

24:45.943 --> 24:47.694
-  You're so good.
-  I want to do it.

24:47.695 --> 24:49.738
I want to do it, too!

24:53.701 --> 24:55.410
- Oh no.
- Oh no.

24:55.411 --> 24:56.745
I'm sorry!

25:00.708 --> 25:02.126
Where do I go?

25:06.463 --> 25:08.465
Where did she go?

25:09.049 --> 25:10.175
I'm sorry!

25:42.916 --> 25:46.502
Then, I'll make you want
to become my friend.

25:46.503 --> 25:48.297
Again?

25:52.384 --> 25:55.095
Oh? Ms. Song!

25:59.058 --> 26:00.683
It's nice being neighbors.

26:00.684 --> 26:03.562
I was going to call you to give you this.

26:04.146 --> 26:05.897
Aren't they pretty?

26:05.898 --> 26:08.274
Green tangerine, lemon, beet…

26:08.275 --> 26:10.485
They're good for…
Hey, you're not coughing.

26:10.486 --> 26:13.197
I'm sorry, but I have to go…

26:13.947 --> 26:15.741
I have to go. Sorry.

26:29.004 --> 26:30.546
Watch the traffic lights!

26:31.924 --> 26:32.925
Are you okay?

26:33.759 --> 26:36.261
Uh… Why were you in such a hurry?

26:38.263 --> 26:39.514
Are you hurt?

26:39.515 --> 26:40.682
Let me see.

26:42.935 --> 26:44.645
Wait.

26:51.193 --> 26:53.695
Sorry, sir.

26:56.240 --> 26:57.740
We should go to a hospital.

26:57.741 --> 26:59.076
It's fine.

26:59.743 --> 27:02.830
No, it's not. You hurt your hand,
and you're a designer.

27:06.083 --> 27:08.001
I'm sorry.

27:08.919 --> 27:11.046
- Let's go get you treated.
- Why did you…

27:14.550 --> 27:17.302
I told you I have no intention
of getting close to you.

27:18.053 --> 27:22.431
It makes me uncomfortable
when you act like we're close.

27:22.432 --> 27:27.144
It may have sounded weird since I'm a guy,
but I didn't mean anything like that--

27:27.145 --> 27:30.064
Whether you're a guy or not,
I don't want to get close.

27:30.065 --> 27:33.610
I can't even go to the cafe
I love the most because of you, and…

27:36.697 --> 27:39.240
I can't keep avoiding you
in the same neighborhood,

27:39.241 --> 27:40.825
so let me be frank.

27:40.826 --> 27:42.411
I'm really sorry,

27:43.787 --> 27:45.914
but I'm a bit weird.

27:46.665 --> 27:49.251
I feel at ease
only if nothing happens in my life.

27:50.085 --> 27:52.253
I hate people entering my life,

27:52.254 --> 27:54.422
and I hate my daily routine
getting disturbed.

27:54.423 --> 27:55.506
I…

27:55.507 --> 27:58.051
I don't need any variables in my life.

27:59.011 --> 28:00.095
Please.

28:07.352 --> 28:09.937
I understand. I get it.

28:09.938 --> 28:13.108
I'll just stand quietly next to you,

28:15.152 --> 28:16.445
so let's go to the hospital.

28:18.030 --> 28:19.281
Your wrist's swollen.

28:22.743 --> 28:24.119
Please.

28:33.879 --> 28:35.880
Uh… It's a Grade 1 sprain.

28:35.881 --> 28:38.382
There's some irritation
to the soft tissue,

28:38.383 --> 28:41.470
so try not to move your wrist too much
for the next two weeks.

28:42.554 --> 28:43.930
The nurse will treat you.

28:43.931 --> 28:45.431
All right. Thank you.

28:45.432 --> 28:47.266
- Just a moment, please.
- Okay.

28:47.267 --> 28:48.310
Thank you.

29:01.782 --> 29:04.158
Come out when you're done.

29:04.159 --> 29:05.369
I'll be waiting outside.

29:12.542 --> 29:16.212
Do I have to keep this on?
My family's going to worry.

29:16.213 --> 29:19.298
You can switch to a brace
and take it off from time to time.

29:19.299 --> 29:22.051
Wearing it for too long
will slow down natural healing,

29:22.052 --> 29:25.429
so check your condition for a few days
and take it off if there's no pain.

29:25.430 --> 29:26.598
Okay.

29:48.453 --> 29:51.622
Number 26, your salad is ready.

29:51.623 --> 29:54.918
I can't even go to the cafe
I love the most because of you, and…

30:33.874 --> 30:35.292
I'm sorry.

30:38.795 --> 30:42.090
I didn't think what I said
bothered you that much.

30:43.383 --> 30:45.177
If I was an uncomfortable variable,

30:46.720 --> 30:47.763
I'm really sorry.

30:48.722 --> 30:49.723
Oh…

30:50.557 --> 30:53.351
So just come to SHIM whenever you want.

30:53.935 --> 30:56.146
It would be a shame
not to be able to go there.

30:56.730 --> 30:57.897
I'll move out.

30:57.898 --> 31:00.191
And walk around the neighborhood
as you want.

31:00.192 --> 31:03.402
I'll leave so we won't
run into each other.

31:03.403 --> 31:04.904
Just give me a few days.

31:04.905 --> 31:05.906
And at work,

31:06.698 --> 31:08.700
I'll pretend nothing happened.

31:09.785 --> 31:11.203
I promise to never create

31:13.080 --> 31:14.372
any variables for you…

31:16.958 --> 31:18.919
or bother you again.

31:20.504 --> 31:22.380
I…

31:23.632 --> 31:26.676
Oh. Sorry, sir. She's getting in.

31:29.805 --> 31:30.888
Go on.

32:08.218 --> 32:10.345
SHIM

32:11.179 --> 32:12.180
Hmm?

32:16.184 --> 32:18.227
Mr. Park, hi.

32:18.228 --> 32:19.229
Hey there.

32:19.855 --> 32:21.689
Sorry for calling you.

32:21.690 --> 32:24.483
You've been coming here every day
for seven years,

32:24.484 --> 32:27.236
so I've been worried
since you haven't come in a while.

32:27.237 --> 32:28.779
Are you sick or anything?

32:28.780 --> 32:30.615
I'm just busy with work.

32:31.116 --> 32:32.826
I'll be back once it's settled.

32:33.994 --> 32:35.078
Yes.

32:36.079 --> 32:37.288
I'm here!

32:37.289 --> 32:38.497
You're late.

32:38.498 --> 32:39.790
You had dinner, right?

32:39.791 --> 32:42.710
Of course.
I enjoyed the stew you cooked for me.

32:42.711 --> 32:45.422
How are you such a good cook?

32:46.339 --> 32:47.966
What about your medicine?

32:53.513 --> 32:56.223
I thought I'd feel safer
if there was someone with me.

32:56.224 --> 32:59.143
And he's adorable.

32:59.144 --> 33:01.437
He's a really good man.

33:01.438 --> 33:03.106
I'll move out.

33:12.282 --> 33:14.408
Of course, I took my medicine.

33:14.409 --> 33:17.870
I get a harsh scolding
from someone named Chan

33:17.871 --> 33:20.164
if I don't take them.

33:23.251 --> 33:24.252
Oh?

33:26.004 --> 33:28.715
This guy must be
going through a transplant shock.

33:29.716 --> 33:31.300
A transplant shock?

33:31.301 --> 33:34.303
When plants are suddenly
put in a different environment…

33:34.304 --> 33:38.182
they go into shock,
thinking, "Where am I"?

33:38.183 --> 33:39.184
Just like humans.

33:40.185 --> 33:44.856
They need time to adjust
to an unexpected variable.

33:45.440 --> 33:46.942
A variable…

33:48.318 --> 33:52.739
What if… they can't adjust?

33:53.615 --> 33:56.076
A lot of them just wither

33:56.993 --> 33:58.536
and die in the end.

33:59.788 --> 34:02.707
It's a pity.

34:05.001 --> 34:07.504
I should clean up.

34:08.171 --> 34:10.339
Wait, I'll do it.

34:10.340 --> 34:14.593
I said I'd kick you out if you do this.
It's my job to do that.

34:14.594 --> 34:18.598
I love cleaning windows.
It's a habit of mine.

34:19.349 --> 34:20.517
My gosh.

34:24.062 --> 34:25.272
All right…

34:30.610 --> 34:33.821
I can't even go to the cafe
I love the most because of you, and…

34:33.822 --> 34:36.491
Come to SHIM whenever you want.
I'll move out.

34:37.117 --> 34:38.409
Mr. Park.

34:38.410 --> 34:40.786
How can you be so adorable?

34:40.787 --> 34:44.791
I feel like I've suddenly gotten a son.

34:46.376 --> 34:48.420
Thank you for being here.

34:53.300 --> 34:54.467
Oh, right.

34:55.927 --> 34:59.431
Weren't you about to say something to me?

35:00.432 --> 35:01.433
I…

35:02.892 --> 35:07.480
I'll clean up here,
so you can go to bed.

35:08.607 --> 35:09.649
All right.

35:10.900 --> 35:11.901
And…

35:13.862 --> 35:15.195
sleep tight.

35:17.282 --> 35:18.449
Okay.

35:18.450 --> 35:19.950
- Good night.
- Good night.

35:19.951 --> 35:21.077
Oh, my.

35:22.787 --> 35:25.040
Tsk.

35:25.957 --> 35:27.959
Tsk.

35:28.460 --> 35:33.381
cafe SHIM

35:38.595 --> 35:39.596
Tsk.

35:49.773 --> 35:52.317
I should have just left her be.

35:53.443 --> 35:54.819
It wasn't my business.

36:03.870 --> 36:05.162
Good work, everyone.

36:05.163 --> 36:06.705
Go, Cheongsol!

36:06.706 --> 36:08.624
Go, Cheongsol!

36:08.625 --> 36:10.459
-  Great work.
-  Great job.

36:10.460 --> 36:11.752
Great job, everyone.

36:13.922 --> 36:15.547
Why are you taking off your pants?

36:15.548 --> 36:16.925
Take my uniform.

36:19.135 --> 36:21.303
Cha Yougyum!
Where are you going?

36:21.304 --> 36:23.098
I'm going to see Hadam!

36:29.145 --> 36:31.438
Hey, Hadam.
I'll be there in three minutes.

36:31.439 --> 36:33.566
It's a green light!

36:34.442 --> 36:37.277
Don't run. I'm still on my way.

36:37.278 --> 36:40.447
LAUNDRY DETERGENT, WHITE MUSK

36:42.659 --> 36:44.326
What is it? Yougyum.

36:47.288 --> 36:48.456
Cha Yougyum!

37:03.847 --> 37:06.181
Hadam!

37:06.182 --> 37:07.267
Song Hadam!

37:15.567 --> 37:17.693
What's wrong, Hadam?

37:17.694 --> 37:21.280
I heard a thud over the phone…

37:21.281 --> 37:24.868
Oh… Sorry. Someone was in danger,
so I had to help them.

37:27.620 --> 37:29.456
It's fine if you're okay.

37:30.206 --> 37:31.957
Is that person okay?

37:31.958 --> 37:33.376
Yes, thankfully.

37:33.960 --> 37:36.629
I promise not to worry you again.
I'm really sorry.

37:37.255 --> 37:39.256
You must have been angry.

37:39.257 --> 37:41.801
No, I like you even more now.

37:42.927 --> 37:44.803
You're so kind.

37:44.804 --> 37:46.638
Grandma told me to bring you home.

37:46.639 --> 37:48.056
Hmm?

37:50.185 --> 37:52.394
My heart's going to explode already.

37:52.395 --> 37:55.147
What do I wear? A suit?
Our school uniform?

37:55.148 --> 37:57.316
Not my baseball uniform.
Should I do my hair?

37:57.317 --> 37:59.401
I should get new socks, and…

37:59.402 --> 38:01.945
First, let's eat something.

38:01.946 --> 38:04.782
I'm hungry
after all that running.

38:04.783 --> 38:06.451
Okay.

38:10.955 --> 38:11.956
Ah.

38:12.540 --> 38:15.752
But do you really think
we can get married before I go?

38:16.544 --> 38:20.215
Yougyum, did you ever see me
failing to carry out a plan?

38:20.924 --> 38:23.009
- No.
- We just have to stick to my plan.

38:24.803 --> 38:25.928
You're so cool.

38:28.681 --> 38:30.516
The game was tough, wasn't it?

38:30.517 --> 38:32.518
It wasn't that tough,

38:32.519 --> 38:35.354
but I feel like I aged 10 years
from missing you so much.

38:35.355 --> 38:37.357
I aged 20 years.

38:43.947 --> 38:45.490
Here. Hang on.

38:47.075 --> 38:48.200
Wait.

38:51.704 --> 38:55.583
Now, this drawing…
will turn into real candy.

38:57.919 --> 39:00.963
- No way.
- That's nonsense.

39:00.964 --> 39:02.256
I mean it.

39:02.257 --> 39:03.883
All right… Mmm.

39:09.347 --> 39:10.973
Look.

39:10.974 --> 39:13.559
- Where did they come from?
- What was that?

39:13.560 --> 39:15.394
They're real.

39:15.395 --> 39:16.687
They're real candy.

39:16.688 --> 39:18.438
Take them. Take them.

39:21.943 --> 39:23.235
These actually are real.

39:23.236 --> 39:24.904
-  How did you do that?
-  Unbelievable.

39:25.029 --> 39:26.030
Hi.

39:30.285 --> 39:32.119
This is some kind of trick, right?

39:32.120 --> 39:35.205
Chan, tell me how you did it.
I want to show my friends.

39:35.206 --> 39:36.623
-  Okay.
- "Chan"?

39:36.624 --> 39:38.375
I'll send a video to our group chat.

39:38.376 --> 39:40.210
Yes!

39:40.211 --> 39:42.337
Right, Chan. We need a revenge match.

39:42.338 --> 39:44.131
- "Group chat"?
-  Let's go bowling again.

39:44.132 --> 39:45.716
Sure. Anytime.

39:45.717 --> 39:47.802
- I want to join, too!
- Me too. Me too.

39:50.805 --> 39:52.764
-  Are you sure?
-  This will be fun.

39:52.765 --> 39:54.433
How will we divide teams?

39:54.434 --> 39:56.018
-  Our teams?
-  Well…

39:56.019 --> 39:57.227
♪ Flip your hands ♪

39:57.228 --> 39:59.354
-  What?
-  What is that?

39:59.355 --> 40:02.441
Let's be friends while I'm in Korea.
Can I be really nice to you?

40:02.442 --> 40:04.276
Sure. Of course.

40:04.277 --> 40:05.569
Of course.

40:05.570 --> 40:08.280
I really wanted to get close to you.

40:08.281 --> 40:10.283
- Sure.
- Yes, sure. I'd love that.

40:11.784 --> 40:14.578
No, you can't.

40:14.579 --> 40:16.914
Whether it's a guy or not,

40:16.915 --> 40:19.334
I have no intention
of getting close to anyone.

40:20.835 --> 40:23.003
Rock, paper…

40:23.004 --> 40:24.254
Okay, rock.

40:24.255 --> 40:25.422
- One, two, three.
-  Okay!

40:27.884 --> 40:29.593
-  This is a revenge match.
-  We won.

40:40.605 --> 40:46.361
Did I overreact
when he asked everyone to be friends?

40:51.991 --> 40:56.119
Then let's select some
dancheong references that will suit Won

40:56.120 --> 40:58.122
and put together a few rough drafts.

40:58.665 --> 40:59.748
Sure.

40:59.749 --> 41:02.542
I'm visiting some palaces
for some research tomorrow.

41:02.543 --> 41:03.961
I'll take a lot of photos.

41:03.962 --> 41:05.546
- Really?
- Yes.

41:07.215 --> 41:08.675
You're going too, right?

41:09.759 --> 41:11.802
- Me?
- Yes, you.

41:11.803 --> 41:14.596
Shouldn't you do something
to show me results?

41:14.597 --> 41:17.432
Well, I have a fabric meeting tomorrow,

41:17.433 --> 41:19.394
- and I have to go to the factory--
- Send Raemee.

41:21.479 --> 41:22.939
Go with him. It's for work.

41:24.357 --> 41:26.942
You can bring Ms. Song with you, right?

41:26.943 --> 41:28.653
Well…

41:29.237 --> 41:33.156
Then can I go to the palaces instead?
Ms. Song can go to the factory…

41:36.661 --> 41:39.162
I would love to go to the factory.

41:39.163 --> 41:42.750
I'll go there, and Ms. Song can go
to the palaces.

41:43.292 --> 41:46.421
Okay. Then let's gather
at our next meeting.

41:47.588 --> 41:50.842
Ms. Kim, when should I go
to the factory tomorrow?

41:54.512 --> 41:56.805
If you feel uneasy,
I'll go on a different date.

41:56.806 --> 41:57.931
You can tell Ms. Kim--

41:57.932 --> 42:00.977
No, let's go. It's for work.

42:04.147 --> 42:05.815
Right. It's for work.

42:06.566 --> 42:08.276
Then I'll text you the details.

42:09.235 --> 42:12.529
And I'm sorry,
but give me some time to move out.

42:12.530 --> 42:14.282
I haven't told Mr. Park yet.

42:15.199 --> 42:16.742
Then I'll see you tomorrow.

42:16.743 --> 42:17.994
I…

42:30.631 --> 42:33.759
Yes. I'm heading to the Lafayette meeting.

42:33.760 --> 42:35.343
I'll call you after.

42:35.344 --> 42:37.804
-  Oh, gosh!
-  What? What is it?

42:37.805 --> 42:38.889
Oh, my gosh!

42:38.890 --> 42:41.058
-  What is it?
-  What's with those flowers?

42:41.059 --> 42:42.309
I received them.

42:42.310 --> 42:43.393
What?

42:43.394 --> 42:46.563
Your date treated you to lunch
and gave you flowers?

42:46.564 --> 42:49.441
Hang on, aren't these ranunculus flowers?

42:49.442 --> 42:51.777
They mean "You're beautiful."

42:51.778 --> 42:54.321
Am I beautiful?

42:54.322 --> 42:56.823
Geez. What's with you?

42:56.824 --> 42:58.617
Are you dating? It doesn't suit you.

42:58.618 --> 43:01.454
Not yet, but we'll meet often.
His workplace is nearby.

43:02.080 --> 43:05.123
So I won't be able to have lunch
with you guys for a while.

43:06.209 --> 43:08.169
-  I'm so jealous.
-  Congratulations!

43:09.003 --> 43:10.837
-  When are you meeting again?
-  Tomorrow.

43:11.923 --> 43:14.133
-  No way.
-  I'm so jealous.

43:15.676 --> 43:17.260
Just to confirm,

43:17.261 --> 43:21.431
do you want to tweak the details
on the Lafayette coat line one more time?

43:21.432 --> 43:25.228
Yes. If you don't mind, we'd appreciate
pushing the delivery back a bit.

43:26.104 --> 43:27.479
I got a boyfriend.

43:27.480 --> 43:28.897
- What do you think?
- Let me see.

43:28.898 --> 43:30.649
- He's so handsome.
- Isn't he?

43:30.650 --> 43:32.567
- What does he do?
-  Let me see. Oh, my gosh.

43:34.112 --> 43:35.154
Hello.

43:35.822 --> 43:39.825
Do you know the meaning
of these ranunculus flowers?

43:39.826 --> 43:41.326
I don't know.

43:41.327 --> 43:42.828
"You're beautiful."

43:42.829 --> 43:43.954
What?

43:43.955 --> 43:45.038
Thank you.

43:46.124 --> 43:48.501
You said you couldn't come today.

43:50.753 --> 43:52.922
Surprise.

43:55.007 --> 43:58.594
He's handsome, right?
"Cha Min." Even his name is nice.

43:59.887 --> 44:01.680
I got these for you.

44:01.681 --> 44:03.683
- What?
- Did you eat?

44:05.017 --> 44:08.145
Mr. Yeon,
would one more week be okay with you?

44:08.146 --> 44:10.565
Oh, yes.

44:12.275 --> 44:13.733
Would you like some coffee?

44:16.028 --> 44:17.655
Thank you.

44:19.323 --> 44:21.742
Hey, you look nice.

44:22.994 --> 44:24.953
It's been a while
since I wore a hanbok.

44:24.954 --> 44:26.037
SINGPUNGNU

44:26.038 --> 44:27.290
Wow, it's so cool.

44:29.500 --> 44:31.836
This is going to be awkward.

44:43.014 --> 44:44.682
You've got to be kidding me.

44:48.811 --> 44:50.271
You're here.

44:51.564 --> 44:53.357
Your outfit…

44:54.317 --> 44:56.568
Ah. The fee is free if we wear a hanbok.

44:56.569 --> 44:58.612
If you want,
there's a rental shop over there…

44:58.613 --> 45:00.489
No, it's completely fine.

45:01.324 --> 45:02.325
All right.

45:03.075 --> 45:04.702
- Let's go, then.
- Okay.

45:36.525 --> 45:38.527
Wow. Aren't they beautiful?

45:39.737 --> 45:41.238
Thanks to the dancheong,

45:41.239 --> 45:44.075
the wood doesn't rot in the rain
and is protected from pests.

45:45.576 --> 45:46.619
Isn't it awesome?

45:47.328 --> 45:48.329
Mmm.

45:48.913 --> 45:50.331
It's just basic knowledge.

45:50.957 --> 45:53.875
I'd like to brag,
but I studied that in advance.

45:53.876 --> 45:55.670
I like showing off my knowledge.

46:00.800 --> 46:02.801
This is my bucket list for Korea.

46:02.802 --> 46:05.096
I'd feel upset if I didn't do all these.

46:06.555 --> 46:10.517
I don't know whether I'll be back
in a decade or two,

46:10.518 --> 46:14.355
or maybe never again.

46:16.899 --> 46:20.068
Wow, hanbok looks so cool.
Can I take a picture?

46:20.069 --> 46:21.444
Of course, why not?

46:21.445 --> 46:22.613
Okay. Guys, come on.

46:23.990 --> 46:25.407
- Okay.
- Kimchi.

46:25.408 --> 46:26.659
Kimchi.

46:27.159 --> 46:28.618
- Thank you.
- Thank you so much.

46:28.619 --> 46:29.829
Have a great day.

46:30.663 --> 46:32.163
Wow, man, it looks good.

46:32.164 --> 46:34.625
Can we take a photo with you, too?

46:35.209 --> 46:36.377
One, two, three.

46:36.961 --> 46:38.837
Thank you.

46:38.838 --> 46:40.755
-  Thank you.
- Thank you. Thank you so much.

46:40.756 --> 46:42.257
-  Have a nice day.
- You too.

46:42.258 --> 46:43.259
Bye.

46:44.051 --> 46:46.469
Ah, sorry,
I wore this to break the ice,

46:46.470 --> 46:48.055
but I didn't expect this.

46:48.848 --> 46:51.225
My clothes are in the locker,
so I'll get changed.

46:53.894 --> 46:55.270
It's the king!

46:57.815 --> 46:59.442
Ice breaking…

47:11.287 --> 47:12.330
Ran!

47:21.672 --> 47:22.756
Huh?

47:22.757 --> 47:26.469
BONGSUDANG

47:27.595 --> 47:28.596
Hmm?

47:30.598 --> 47:31.599
Where did she go?

47:32.683 --> 47:33.934
Did she go to the restroom?

47:55.414 --> 47:56.457
Huh?

47:56.999 --> 47:59.293
She left her phone here?

48:27.029 --> 48:28.822
Where in the world is she?

48:41.961 --> 48:43.044
What…

48:44.422 --> 48:45.589
Ms. Song!

48:53.514 --> 48:55.181
You just disappeared.

48:55.182 --> 48:56.558
What is it?

48:56.559 --> 48:58.059
Let's go. We have to work.

48:58.060 --> 49:00.019
What's wrong?

49:00.020 --> 49:01.647
- It's nothing.
- I…

49:02.440 --> 49:06.359
I know you hate others meddling,
but let me meddle just this once.

49:06.360 --> 49:09.487
What's wrong? I'm honestly worried.

49:13.075 --> 49:16.203
Then, let's sit for a moment.

49:16.829 --> 49:18.413
My legs…

49:20.166 --> 49:21.750
Let's sit for a while.

49:31.218 --> 49:32.761
I heard a voice.

49:39.185 --> 49:40.227
Ran!

49:45.149 --> 49:47.276
Someone called my name,
so I went to look.

49:48.277 --> 49:49.445
Ran!

49:53.991 --> 49:55.241
KIM RAN

49:55.242 --> 49:56.785
- I'll try it first.
- Okay.

49:57.828 --> 50:01.290
But her voice
was so similar to my mom's.

50:02.500 --> 50:04.418
Ran, come here.

50:09.548 --> 50:12.593
It sounded like
my mom was actually calling me,

50:13.677 --> 50:15.470
so I burst into tears.

50:15.471 --> 50:16.472
Mom.

50:19.391 --> 50:21.434
Ran, Ran.

50:21.435 --> 50:24.063
My mom always called me like that.

50:35.908 --> 50:37.992
-  I like this song!
-  Mmm?

50:37.993 --> 50:40.119
It's Hadam's favorite song.

50:40.120 --> 50:41.579
It is.

50:43.165 --> 50:45.166
Hadam, do you want
to say hi to your sisters?

50:45.167 --> 50:47.043
- Yes.
- Okay.

50:47.044 --> 50:48.253
Hi!

50:48.254 --> 50:51.090
-  Hi.
-  They look so excited.

51:11.026 --> 51:12.152
Mom.

51:12.695 --> 51:13.778
Dad.

51:14.947 --> 51:16.156
Dad…

51:31.755 --> 51:33.674
Dad! Dad!

51:34.341 --> 51:35.342
Dad!

51:37.511 --> 51:39.137
Mom!

51:39.138 --> 51:40.306
Mom, get up! Mom!

51:41.098 --> 51:43.767
Mom!

51:46.854 --> 51:47.896
Please!

51:48.647 --> 51:51.024
- Mom!
- Dad.

51:51.025 --> 51:52.567
Dad!

51:52.568 --> 51:54.444
Help us!

51:56.572 --> 51:59.700
They said the driver
suddenly had a cardiac arrest.

52:00.367 --> 52:02.286
Both my parents died on the spot,

52:03.078 --> 52:06.624
right in front of me.

52:09.001 --> 52:11.086
I know she wasn't calling me,

52:11.670 --> 52:13.631
and that I was mistaken,

52:15.633 --> 52:17.675
but when I heard her voice,

52:17.676 --> 52:20.846
I think I felt happy for a split second.

52:21.889 --> 52:23.891
I know that sounds strange.

52:24.433 --> 52:26.310
Well, you felt like someone you miss

52:27.144 --> 52:29.063
called your name.

52:34.693 --> 52:36.194
Chan.

52:36.195 --> 52:37.779
I love you.

52:37.780 --> 52:39.238
I love you, Chan.

52:45.037 --> 52:47.164
It's not strange at all.

52:53.128 --> 52:54.129
Ah…

52:55.506 --> 52:58.675
I guess I was showing off again.

53:01.512 --> 53:03.096
I'm sorry.

53:03.097 --> 53:04.098
What?

53:04.640 --> 53:07.100
Oh. It's fine.
I was almost done looking around.

53:07.101 --> 53:09.061
I'm really sorry

53:10.312 --> 53:12.064
for lashing out at you until now.

53:13.565 --> 53:15.943
You did nothing wrong,

53:17.486 --> 53:19.238
but I was so harsh on you.

53:20.072 --> 53:21.782
And those fruit syrups last time…

53:22.908 --> 53:24.410
I'm really sorry.

53:25.327 --> 53:27.912
No, it's all my fault.

53:27.913 --> 53:31.457
I shouldn't have said all that stuff
about being friends.

53:31.458 --> 53:32.584
I'm sorry.

53:33.127 --> 53:34.712
Look, you're doing it again.

53:35.796 --> 53:37.798
I'm the one who's weird.

53:38.924 --> 53:43.386
I keep making other people apologize
when I'm the one who's sorry.

53:43.387 --> 53:46.180
I know I'm being rude and cruel,

53:46.181 --> 53:50.185
and I want to change,
but I don't know how.

53:50.978 --> 53:54.440
Getting close to someone
is really difficult…

53:55.566 --> 53:56.608
No,

53:57.568 --> 53:59.278
it's scary for me.

54:03.782 --> 54:06.827
Losing someone you care about
without warning

54:07.578 --> 54:09.370
is already painful enough…

54:11.665 --> 54:15.502
...but it happened to me again…
so cruelly.

54:17.296 --> 54:19.214
So I run away before it happens.

54:20.883 --> 54:24.887
Because I feel like I'll crumble
if that happens again.

54:27.848 --> 54:29.767
If no one is special to me,

54:30.809 --> 54:33.020
then at least nothing bad will happen.

54:35.647 --> 54:39.526
At first, I put up walls
to protect myself,

54:40.861 --> 54:43.447
but now, I feel like
I'm trapped behind them.

54:48.827 --> 54:51.497
Darn it. I must be crazy.
What am I doing?

54:54.458 --> 54:55.792
You're so strange.

54:56.418 --> 54:57.753
Me?

54:59.671 --> 55:04.176
As soon as the three months is over,
I'll disappear without a trace.

55:05.177 --> 55:08.055
Maybe it's because you'll leave soon.

55:08.847 --> 55:09.848
Hm.

55:10.432 --> 55:11.600
Huh?

55:18.774 --> 55:20.441
That's beautiful.

55:24.613 --> 55:26.532
I should take photos.

55:27.908 --> 55:30.326
Huh? My bag.

55:30.327 --> 55:31.994
I left my bag behind.

55:31.995 --> 55:34.038
I'll go and get it…

55:34.039 --> 55:35.207
Wait. What are you doing?

55:35.791 --> 55:38.334
- What?
- Don't you need your bag, too?

55:39.419 --> 55:41.380
My bag! Oh, gosh!

55:41.964 --> 55:43.549
Come on.

55:54.226 --> 55:55.686
I also just got off work.

55:57.312 --> 55:58.771
Oh.

55:58.772 --> 56:00.648
You're coming here?

56:00.649 --> 56:02.109
Sure, let's meet up.

56:02.818 --> 56:05.945
But, Mr. Cha, are you walking here?

56:05.946 --> 56:08.864
Wow, that's so close. I'll see you in 10--

56:08.865 --> 56:10.993
Ms. Kim wants you in her office.

56:12.077 --> 56:14.495
Me? Um…

56:14.496 --> 56:16.664
Oh. Sorry, but can you wait--

56:16.665 --> 56:19.625
She wants to see you immediately.

56:19.626 --> 56:21.335
And it will take a while.

56:21.336 --> 56:22.379
Why?

56:25.340 --> 56:31.220
I'm sorry, something came up.
I don't think we can meet today.

56:31.221 --> 56:32.848
I'll call you later. Bye.

56:33.682 --> 56:36.018
Why is she asking for me?

56:39.396 --> 56:41.064
You'll know when you get there.

56:42.357 --> 56:43.734
Did I do something wrong?

56:47.904 --> 56:49.865
Excuse me.

56:50.449 --> 56:51.742
I heard you were…

56:52.576 --> 56:55.287
looking for me…

56:56.246 --> 56:57.496
Where is she?

56:59.499 --> 57:03.879
Mmm… Then I'll refer to the dancheong
we saw today and…

57:04.463 --> 57:06.255
- Hey, Donggu.
- Hey!

57:06.256 --> 57:07.590
Were you practicing soccer?

57:07.591 --> 57:09.467
- Yes. But, Chan…
- Yes?

57:09.468 --> 57:11.927
This thing you did with the ball.

57:11.928 --> 57:14.513
Can you show us again?

57:14.514 --> 57:15.807
Again?

57:16.391 --> 57:17.851
Hmm.

57:19.269 --> 57:21.437
Since my dear Donggu is asking,

57:21.438 --> 57:23.064
- of course, I'll do it for you.
- Yes!

57:23.065 --> 57:25.358
Watch.

57:25.359 --> 57:26.609
Here.

57:27.819 --> 57:30.613
- You're so good. Wow!
- You're amazing.

57:30.614 --> 57:31.947
You're like Son Heungmin!

57:31.948 --> 57:33.741
Nice, Donggu.

57:35.077 --> 57:38.496
But my shoes aren't comfy,
and I'm with someone today,

57:38.497 --> 57:40.206
- so that's it for today.
-  Okay.

57:40.207 --> 57:41.540
Here you go.

57:41.541 --> 57:43.084
- See you later.
-  Okay.

57:43.085 --> 57:44.418
Bye.

57:44.419 --> 57:45.920
- Bye.
-  Bye.

57:45.921 --> 57:47.255
Bye.

57:47.964 --> 57:49.758
Let's go have pizza!

57:50.342 --> 57:52.593
He's Kim Donggu.
He lives in the neighborhood.

57:52.594 --> 57:55.346
We started talking and grew close.
We really clicked.

57:55.347 --> 57:57.766
Hang on.

57:59.101 --> 58:02.645
It's Je Raemee.
It's about our bowling game.

58:02.646 --> 58:05.565
You really are a human capybara.

58:06.566 --> 58:09.860
A capybara?
The animal that looks like a huge rat?

58:09.861 --> 58:14.532
Well… I've never heard
that I look like a rat before.

58:14.533 --> 58:18.577
Oh. I just meant how you get close
to everyone around you.

58:18.578 --> 58:20.664
Look it up. You're exactly the same.

58:25.585 --> 58:28.629
Anyway, thanks for everything today.
Let's head home now.

58:28.630 --> 58:29.881
I'll get going.

58:51.737 --> 58:54.656
Let me make it clear
since you seem to have misunderstood.

58:55.449 --> 58:58.785
It's true that I want
to get close to everyone.

58:59.870 --> 59:03.081
But I meant something else
when I asked us to be friends.

59:06.918 --> 59:08.170
I wanted to show you…

59:09.546 --> 59:11.047
that there's another way.

59:12.132 --> 59:15.301
At first, I was curious
why you were standing

59:15.302 --> 59:18.012
in front of that winter painting
by yourself.

59:18.013 --> 59:20.848
And while working with you
and watching you,

59:20.849 --> 59:23.435
I thought that perhaps…

59:24.436 --> 59:28.774
you thought the person standing alone
in that painting was you.

59:33.153 --> 59:37.199
So I know it's not my place,
but I wanted to show you something…

59:40.118 --> 59:41.953
that someone else showed me before.

59:43.330 --> 59:47.666
You know, I used to go to bed
every night as a child

59:47.667 --> 59:49.169
hoping that day would be the last.

59:50.629 --> 59:52.172
But I kept waking up,

59:52.964 --> 59:56.467
and I lived like a corpse…

59:56.468 --> 59:58.136
He's so weird.
Welcome him.

01:00:01.932 --> 01:00:03.308
No, he's a crazy guy.

01:00:05.727 --> 01:00:07.561
…with no hope, expression, or color.

01:00:11.149 --> 01:00:13.527
Then when I truly thought
it didn't matter if I died

01:00:14.444 --> 01:00:15.903
and decided to end everything…

01:00:22.202 --> 01:00:24.662
...someone suddenly talked to me.

01:00:24.663 --> 01:00:25.746
Purely by coincidence.

01:00:25.747 --> 01:00:27.082
"You're…

01:00:29.835 --> 01:00:31.418
my savior."

01:00:35.465 --> 01:00:37.008
Congratulations, and…

01:00:38.218 --> 01:00:39.719
you…

01:00:42.806 --> 01:00:46.059
saved me as well.

01:00:47.269 --> 01:00:50.105
That coincidence made me stop,

01:00:51.147 --> 01:00:53.650
and my daily life
started changing as well.

01:01:01.241 --> 01:01:04.493
I finally got the sketch sample
for my design.

01:01:04.494 --> 01:01:07.955
Make some noise!
It's all thanks to this pen.

01:01:07.956 --> 01:01:11.084
The words that person said to me
made me smile.

01:01:11.793 --> 01:01:14.838
Thank you for helping me
not give up on what I love.

01:01:15.505 --> 01:01:17.340
For giving me a reason to keep going.

01:01:18.091 --> 01:01:20.969
For the first time,
I started looking forward to the next day.

01:01:33.648 --> 01:01:34.691
And…

01:01:35.650 --> 01:01:37.652
I wanted to find a reason to keep going...

01:01:39.654 --> 01:01:44.034
...thanks to that person
who kept reaching out and talking to me.

01:02:00.508 --> 01:02:04.512
So… you can overcome it.

01:02:05.138 --> 01:02:06.681
Once you know how,

01:02:07.807 --> 01:02:10.018
you'll be able to escape on your own.

01:02:10.560 --> 01:02:14.772
I learned it through that person,
so I wanted to show you, too.

01:02:21.029 --> 01:02:22.739
I've also been trapped

01:02:23.323 --> 01:02:25.992
in a long winter all by myself.

01:02:30.997 --> 01:02:32.540
Is his name Mong?

01:02:34.167 --> 01:02:36.169
You're so cute, Mong.

01:02:37.379 --> 01:02:38.630
Let's take a picture.

01:02:39.714 --> 01:02:42.258
I can't hear on this side.

01:02:43.259 --> 01:02:44.843
I wanted to get close

01:02:44.844 --> 01:02:46.845
because you reminded me of my past.

01:02:48.223 --> 01:02:49.975
I'm sorry
if I made you uncomfortable.

01:02:50.392 --> 01:02:52.434
Three. Hey, Mong.
Look at the camera.

01:02:52.435 --> 01:02:54.937
- But I guess that doesn't matter.
- One, two, three.

01:03:00.151 --> 01:03:01.152
Excuse me!

01:03:02.988 --> 01:03:04.239
What?

01:03:05.699 --> 01:03:06.949
What is it?

01:03:06.950 --> 01:03:07.951
Take this.

01:03:09.577 --> 01:03:10.578
Oh…

01:03:12.706 --> 01:03:15.333
You didn't get to drink your favorite milk
because of me.

01:03:24.884 --> 01:03:28.388
Is your suggestion still valid?

01:03:28.972 --> 01:03:30.015
What?

01:03:30.598 --> 01:03:33.017
Hang on, I'll go over there.

01:03:34.310 --> 01:03:35.770
No, I'll go.

01:03:49.325 --> 01:03:51.786
Sorry, I didn't hear you.
What did you say?

01:03:52.412 --> 01:03:53.830
And what's with this milk?

01:03:54.831 --> 01:03:57.332
Is it still valid?

01:03:57.333 --> 01:03:58.334
What?

01:03:59.794 --> 01:04:01.462
Oh. The expiration date?

01:04:01.463 --> 01:04:02.672
Not the milk.

01:04:03.298 --> 01:04:06.175
I mean… being friends.

01:04:06.176 --> 01:04:07.844
The three-month trial.

01:04:08.970 --> 01:04:10.472
Is that still valid?

01:04:14.893 --> 01:04:16.603
I'd like to learn.

01:04:17.395 --> 01:04:19.147
Can you show me?

01:04:20.815 --> 01:04:24.110
You said someone showed you
how to escape from winter.

01:04:28.907 --> 01:04:29.990
Uh…

01:04:29.991 --> 01:04:31.868
I guess I'm too late.

01:04:32.952 --> 01:04:36.163
I understand.
I was so cruel to you.

01:04:36.164 --> 01:04:38.832
I'm so pathetic,
going back and forth like this.

01:04:38.833 --> 01:04:42.127
I'm just curious
whether I can change as well.

01:04:42.128 --> 01:04:46.341
And I thought it would be okay
if there's a time limit.

01:04:47.258 --> 01:04:49.343
Never mind. Just forget--

01:04:49.344 --> 01:04:50.553
It's valid.

01:04:54.015 --> 01:04:55.809
It's still valid.

01:04:56.726 --> 01:04:57.727
Ah…

01:04:58.728 --> 01:05:00.188
It's valid…

01:05:02.023 --> 01:05:04.025
Well, I…

01:05:05.151 --> 01:05:09.696
The nurse told me
that if I keep this on for too long,

01:05:09.697 --> 01:05:12.951
I wouldn't be able to heal naturally.

01:05:13.618 --> 01:05:14.993
So I thought

01:05:14.994 --> 01:05:17.664
I shouldn't stay trapped
behind my own barriers…

01:05:18.498 --> 01:05:21.792
I'm saying this because I…

01:05:21.793 --> 01:05:26.548
Then, it's okay
to be really nice to you now, right?

01:05:30.510 --> 01:05:31.511
Just three months.

01:05:32.470 --> 01:05:33.721
A trial period.

01:05:36.349 --> 01:05:38.642
I'll do my best to learn, too.

01:05:41.980 --> 01:05:42.981
Okay.

01:05:44.399 --> 01:05:46.066
Then let's do this.

01:05:46.067 --> 01:05:48.069
It'll be like we're on a spring picnic.

01:05:48.736 --> 01:05:49.779
Let's have fun.

01:06:28.359 --> 01:06:30.111
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:06:54.177 --> 01:06:56.303
It was my first time
hearing that sound.

01:06:56.304 --> 01:06:59.473
What if there is still
an empty spot in your memories

01:06:59.474 --> 01:07:00.933
that you're not aware of?

01:07:00.934 --> 01:07:04.186
I told you a secret,
so next time it's your turn.

01:07:04.187 --> 01:07:07.064
It seemed like
she might have dementia.

01:07:07.065 --> 01:07:10.359
So please…
Keep this a secret for now.

01:07:10.360 --> 01:07:12.653
It can't be, right?

01:07:12.654 --> 01:07:15.239
You have a crush
on Ms. Song, don't you?

01:07:15.240 --> 01:07:16.615
"That person"?

01:07:16.616 --> 01:07:18.450
I…

01:07:18.451 --> 01:07:20.161
...shouldn't have asked you for a ride.

01:07:20.995 --> 01:07:24.123
As long as she becomes happy,
I don't care what happens.

01:07:36.135 --> 01:07:37.219
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:07:37.220 --> 01:07:38.221
Translated by Juyoung Park
